37745>>>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
37748>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
37748>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
37748>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
37748>>>>>        Handle hoDD
37748>>>>>
37748>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
37749>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
37750>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
37751>>>>>
37751>>>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
37751>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
37752>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
37753>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
37754>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
37755>>>>>
37755>>>>>        If (NavigateData.bReadOnly) Begin
37757>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to True
37758>>>>>        End
37758>>>>>>
37758>>>>>        Else Begin
37759>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
37760>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
37761>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
37762>>>>>        End
37762>>>>>>
37762>>>>>    End_Procedure
